config MEMC
    bool
    help
      Cores of the memory controllers that drive memories of more than
      one kind, each kind with a driver in its own subsystem. Selected
      by those drivers.

config MEMC_SF32LB52_MPI
    bool
    select MEMC
    select CLK
    select PINCTRL
    help
      Core of the SiFli SF32LB52 MPI controller: what its SPI memory
      and HyperBus drivers share.
